        "message": "feat(NG-001): honest NET-GATE dossier and real fail-closed validator\n\nThe declared validate-netgate.mjs stub is now a real validator. It checks\nall 10 master §5.2 criteria, their statuses and cited command/exit/log, refuses\na fabricated NOT COMPUTABLE claim, keeps the failing wire budget failing at\n3.79x, carries the seven threat risks verbatim, and rejects any agent\nsignature. Integrity passes; --assert-ready still exits 1 with 8/10 unmet.\nInjecting wire-budget: met makes it fail closed.\n\nThe Director said 'je signe tout'. A0006 and GATE_NET.md transcribe it\nverbatim as a signed-with-risk governance fact — NOT passed. No criterion,\nmeasurement or unmeasured field was changed to obtain the signature. PR merges\nremain Director-only; no agent self-merged and no art was produced.\n\nNG-001 gained co: [qa-engineer, netcode-engineer] so B2 accepts the\nappend-only dossier path. FULL §20 result emitted for this gate task.\n\nAcceptance: integrity 0, readiness 1, negative 1, verify 17/17, tracer green.\n\nAgent: producer\nTask: NG-001",
